                  "text": "Bikh. 7.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kamakuumba ka Yosefu niko Baisiraeli basuta khukhwama e Misiri, kasiikhwa e Shekemu, mu sitonyi sie kumukuunda nikwo Yakobo akula khukhwama khu ba okhwa Hamori (Hamori aaba raraawe owa Shekemu.) Yakobo akula kumukuunda okwo khu bukusi bwe bitonyi bie efwesa emia ndala. Kumukuunda kuno kwekela kumukabwa kwe lisaaye lia Yosefu.",
          "type": "text",
